WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.268
(light playful music)

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.740
- You see, gentlemen,
I'm gonna be president

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:13.883
of the United States.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.100
Now I don't say that impress you

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.640
or to seem terribly precocious.

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:20.473
I'm merely stating a fact.

00:00:20.473 --> 00:00:24.433
I will be president someday
because I will stop at nothing.

00:00:25.482 --> 00:00:28.649
(light playful music)

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.000
And as student body president,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.270
I will ensure that every student

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.700
at this school has an equal
opportunity to succeed.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.050
If you choose to honor me by electing me,

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.260
I will fight for each and every one of you

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:41.888
so long as there is
strength in me to fight.

00:00:41.888 --> 00:00:45.055
(light playful music)

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:50.753
I'm not a good person, all right?

00:00:52.460 --> 00:00:55.080
I try to do good things right,
but I'm not a good person!

00:00:55.080 --> 00:00:56.146
That's my flaw.

00:00:56.146 --> 00:00:59.313
(light playful music)

00:01:07.651 --> 00:01:08.629
- We need to break up.

00:01:08.629 --> 00:01:09.523
- You said you wouldn't judge me!

00:01:09.523 --> 00:01:11.848
- Not really break up, we
need to pretend to break up

00:01:11.848 --> 00:01:13.469
in order for you to win the election.

00:01:13.469 --> 00:01:16.636
(light playful music)

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.563
- You're gonna change the world, Payton.

00:01:22.257 --> 00:01:23.971
- How do you know?

00:01:23.971 --> 00:01:25.351
- Because I see you.

00:01:25.351 --> 00:01:28.518
(light playful music)

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:35.420
- My loyalty is with you, Payton.

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:36.253
This is a plane.

00:01:36.253 --> 00:01:37.330
We're all headed to the same place.

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.180
You're the pilot, James
and I are your navigators.

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.120
- Neither one of us knows
how to fly like you can.

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:42.890
We need you to get us to the White House,

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:44.070
but we wouldn't be doing our job

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.570
if we weren't being honest with you.

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:47.663
If we don't tell it like
it is, we'll all crash.

00:01:47.663 --> 00:01:50.830
(light playful music)

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:54.980
- Not to toot our own horns,
- Toot!

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:56.230
But we've won karaoke night

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:57.980
at the Wapakoneta Summer Cheer Camp

00:01:57.980 --> 00:01:59.350
every year since we were three.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:00.620
It's in our blood.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:03.787
(light playful music)

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.517
(eerie discordant music)

00:02:10.882 --> 00:02:14.510
(light playful music)

00:02:14.510 --> 00:02:16.223
- Screw you very much, Payton.

00:02:17.850 --> 00:02:19.222
Hell of a campaign.

00:02:19.222 --> 00:02:22.080
(light playful music)

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:23.673
- We should have him assassinated.

00:02:25.400 --> 00:02:26.319
Too dark?

00:02:26.319 --> 00:02:29.486
(light playful music)

00:02:30.654 --> 00:02:33.487
- I think that everyday is a gift.

00:02:34.860 --> 00:02:38.770
And every time that I
wake up, even if I have

00:02:38.770 --> 00:02:41.100
to get a platelet
transfusion from Dr. Singal,

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:42.000
I think to myself,

00:02:44.810 --> 00:02:47.470
a lot of kids around the world

00:02:47.470 --> 00:02:49.240
don't have the same
medical care that I do,

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:52.803
so if that's what I have to go through,

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:55.847
that's God's plan.

00:02:55.847 --> 00:02:59.014
(light playful music)

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.830
- I might have some

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:06.000
psychological problems, you know?

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.080
And I think

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:13.299
I probably need to get some help.

00:03:13.299 --> 00:03:15.770
(light playful music)

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:18.678
- Wow, just wow.

00:03:18.678 --> 00:03:21.845
(light playful music)

00:03:22.755 --> 00:03:24.407
(boys slapping hands)
- Boys, boys!

00:03:24.407 --> 00:03:25.907
Boys, you stop that right now!

00:03:26.770 --> 00:03:29.924
This negative energy is not
good for your father' healing.

00:03:29.924 --> 00:03:33.091
(light playful music)

00:03:34.880 --> 00:03:37.080
Your generation got the terrible idea

00:03:37.080 --> 00:03:39.330
that it was best to vomit every thought

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:41.430
and feeling all over each other.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.590
It's a pandemic of overcommunication

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:45.852
that's led to an absence of intimacy.

00:03:45.852 --> 00:03:49.019
(light playful music)

00:03:57.660 --> 00:04:00.833
- The only shame I feel
is when I look at you.

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.070
You're a quitter and a loser

00:04:04.810 --> 00:04:07.125
and the greatest
disappointment of my life.

00:04:07.125 --> 00:04:10.960
(light playful music)

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:11.803
- I'm not happy.

00:04:12.970 --> 00:04:14.720
I don't wanna hate my life anymore.

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:19.140
- Not happy is not a reason
to put us through all of this.

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:21.621
Not happy is what antidepressants are for.

00:04:21.621 --> 00:04:24.788
(light playful music)

00:04:32.565 --> 00:04:34.920
- Should we be worried?

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:37.109
- Worried? (laughs)

00:04:37.109 --> 00:04:38.750
No.

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:41.793
This is gonna be fun. (laughs)

00:04:42.780 --> 00:04:45.163
We're gonna eat him alive.

00:04:47.489 --> 00:04:50.656
(light playful music)

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:57.833
- I am tough,

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:00.838
but I'm no cookie.

00:05:00.838 --> 00:05:04.500
(light playful music)

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.610
- Do not screw with my dream, all right?

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:09.590
I'm on a singular path, 'kay?

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:12.757
(light playful music)

00:05:20.073 --> 00:05:25.073
♪ Dream on but don't imagine
it will all come true ♪

00:05:26.396 --> 00:05:31.396
♪ When will you realize
Vienna waits for you ♪

00:05:34.686 --> 00:05:38.444
♪ All things go, all things go ♪

00:05:38.444 --> 00:05:42.174
♪ We had our mindset ♪

00:05:42.174 --> 00:05:46.134
♪ All things go, all things go ♪

00:05:46.134 --> 00:05:49.924
♪ You have to find it ♪

00:05:49.924 --> 00:05:52.140
♪ All things go ♪

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:55.307
(light playful music)

00:05:57.354 --> 00:05:59.521
- Oh ho ho, well hot damn!

00:06:00.876 --> 00:06:04.043
(light playful music)

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:06.910
- You live over on Hermosa Road, right?

00:06:06.910 --> 00:06:10.318
What many would consider the
other side of the tracks?

00:06:10.318 --> 00:06:12.890
(light playful music)

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.190
- I'm turning over every
one of these firearms

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:17.040
to the Santa Barbara
County Sheriff's Department

00:06:17.040 --> 00:06:18.560
who will deliver them this afternoon

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:21.500
to the Dowell Aluminum
and Foundry in Carpinteria

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:23.330
to melted down into steel rebar

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:24.830
that sophomore Dallas Weintraub

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:26.910
will then sculpt into
an abstract art piece

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:29.090
about America's gun violence epidemic,

00:06:29.090 --> 00:06:30.060
which will premier this June

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.250
at Santa Barbara's ForReal Gallery

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:33.082
as part of this year's Downtown Arts Walk.

00:06:33.082 --> 00:06:36.249
(light playful music)

00:06:39.873 --> 00:06:41.160
They took those morons!

00:06:41.160 --> 00:06:43.470
- Well, your father and
I bought their way in.

00:06:43.470 --> 00:06:44.530
We were very clear.

00:06:44.530 --> 00:06:46.927
You said you wanted to do this properly.

00:06:46.927 --> 00:06:49.320
- No, no, I can't get in
that way, people know it.

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.153
It stays with you.

00:06:50.153 --> 00:06:52.968
It's handing your opponent in
a negative ad on a platter!

00:06:52.968 --> 00:06:56.135
(light playful music)

00:06:58.167 --> 00:07:01.000
(people clapping)

